Give the simulator's Metal window and ring targets one depth-stencil texture.

The simulator's Metal requires a render pipeline's depth and stencil
attachment formats to match, and aborts with a validation assertion
otherwise. A borrowed ring's own depth and a CAMetalLayer target's depth made
a separate Depth32Float and Stencil8 on every arm64 target, so the native
suites aborted on the iOS and tvOS simulators. Upstream:
https://github.com/louwers/mln-rs/pull/402

